{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Microlandia is a meticulously accurate city builder with a complex simulation under the hood.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The structures of everyday life, simulated</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094120/extras/c713568bb6af0fc5c835356e03c7a358.webp?t=1769151801\" width=10 height=16 /></span>\u00a0Citizens get sick and if there's no hospital capacity, they die waiting for healthcare.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094120/extras/63d29acbd0c8cf0633c959c9266efd98.webp?t=1769151801\" width=16 height=10 /></span>\u00a0If they show up late for work they could get fired.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094120/extras/5c02516fe60ff0f92225e6d3c0f5b15f.webp?t=1769151801\" width=12 height=12 /></span>\u00a0Some of them will strongly oppose controversial construction projects in their neighborhood, leading to public backlash and moving away.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094120/extras/f1fb041ab14803a0a3a5504edc856fa7.webp?t=1769151801\" width=14 height=15 /></span>\u00a0When companies don't make ends meet, they go bankrupt and unemployment rises.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094120/extras/77a447a52b02f9e6d2c591738226ac20.webp?t=1769151801\" width=12 height=16 /></span>\u00a0Landlords are greedy and increase rents when the supply is scarce.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094120/extras/631d7ed81bacff3cf327d7125025b913.webp?t=1769151801\" width=13 height=12 /></span>\u00a0Citizens fall in and out of love and can have children.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094120/extras/66fa0646090e67919a8eb5f51870344b.webp?t=1769151801\" width=13 height=15 /></span>\u00a0When citizens can't find a job for some time, they consider a career in the criminal underworld.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hard decisions with strong impact</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094120/extras/5beb32544168ee05094c25bc4e59a1bf.webp?t=1769151801\" width=14 height=12 /></span>\u00a0Tax rates for property, income, sales and corporate revenue changes shape the economics of your city in complex ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094120/extras/99611b4141f05a9ae2c9ded1492c4648.webp?t=1769151801\" width=16 height=11 /></span>\u00a0City infrastructure is a huge investment for the city.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094120/extras/77a447a52b02f9e6d2c591738226ac20.webp?t=1769151801\" width=12 height=16 /></span>\u00a0Fees for car licenses, public transport, tourism and business incorporation shifts the delicate balance between city revenue and people's incentives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094120/extras/46d79aa345b067eaa3f72bd3e510a804.webp?t=1769151801\" width=16 height=13 /></span>\u00a0A newspaper tracks your every move and reports on all the city's happenings and problems you will be blamed for.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094120/extras/ae498ca987a7bca08901c820ce101dd3.webp?t=1769151801\" width=13 height=14 /></span>\u00a0Rezoning land is extremely difficult as you need to compensate the property owners and inhabitants.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094120/extras/bf97d7e6a0065b188da1e3bd6299b70c.webp?t=1769151801\" width=13 height=13 /></span>\u00a0Recessions, heatwaves, pandemics and other random events will test your capacity and planning.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Modeled after data from real cities</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094120/extras/12c5b42f7e1e6745d8d4a81f028c49a7.webp?t=1769151801\" width=15 height=15 /></span>\u00a0Simulation mechanics are carefully modeled after publications like World Bank Open Data, U.S. Bureau of Labor Statistics, U.S. Environmental Protection Agency, National Equity Atlas, Center for Urban Future and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094120/extras/58d1a6be3636b7215cedd57f0609ff39.webp?t=1769151801\" width=13 height=13 /></span>\u00a0The objective is to build a good enough simulation so it can provide real insights into the social, economic, and environmental challenges of modern life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094120/extras/0693b382e983471e5ad0ae7b76da3c05.webp?t=1769151801\" width=15 height=15 /></span>\u00a0The simulation parameters are open and we have a live generated page in our website where you can read all about the inner workings of the sim.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Active development</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094120/extras/13d2b37fae295ce6beecf809e8ae7a20.webp?t=1769151801\" width=14 height=12 /></span>\u00a0The game is under active development and we have ambitious plans for years to come. In new versions, we aim to add new mechanics,  features and make the simulation deeper to capture the complexity of city life in great detail.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094120/extras/940f20dca1700008e7b5017648e0ee17.webp?t=1769151801\" width=10 height=16 /></span>\u00a0There will be no Microlandia 2. Instead, we will keep updating and improving.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094120/extras/1f42e21a8349c07249e5a3fd84de35f0.webp?t=1769151801\" width=13 height=13 /></span>\u00a0No DLCs or expansions. All content updates will be included in future versions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094120/extras/253f5d363581f896468cee7baddadff6.webp?t=1769151801\" width=13 height=13 /></span>\u00a0No in-game purchases, we believe it's the worst invention since pineapple in pizza. </p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Locality","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4094120/af8270cb90a4a3ab749ff1242df93a5098483ecf.jpg"},{"name":"Town","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4094120/09cb91546ff1954f6cfb9777f7fe1c6cf9411b00.jpg"},{"name":"City","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4094120/17fdc1e4cabb6d56c66dfc93d2ff18f98feadaf6.jpg"},{"name":"Road Warrior","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4094120/6f4814aabb41bac15faef43c61dab067c257a0aa.jpg"},{"name":"Lawn and order","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4094120/1a922fcd4d32f5a8f2497e2e0cbb889805e93d18.jpg"},{"name":"Thin Blue Line","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4094120/48868bf062a2f16836facb48b0270bddd1f5cd4a.jpg"},{"name":"Greed Is Good","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4094120/8092f5ce6eb229b2a78aca25a9cb217a189e9d05.jpg"},{"name":"Wisdom Infrastructure","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4094120/e2bbc9de66412b6c02ef8788f83ff97a970f634e.jpg"},{"name":"The Botanist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4094120/ecc3b497885325cc11e07f24ba178b0f52132da0.jpg"}],"total":9},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4094120?t=1769151801","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4094120?t=1769151801","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094120/a5729a02fee4b5639ba0e0389412cfad4516178b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769151801","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094120/a5729a02fee4b5639ba0e0389412cfad4516178b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769151801","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"des